Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.26,0:00:11.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,初中生田中爱之助自幼左眼几乎失明。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:15.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他在幼年时便失去了双亲，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.03,0:00:17.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一直由哥哥梦人照顾抚养。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:25.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,梦人得知爱之助有绘画天赋，便提议让他接受眼部手术，并由梦人捐献了自己的左眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:31.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,后来梦人因意外身亡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.10,0:00:33.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助无法接受哥哥的死，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.83,0:00:36.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,决心无论如何都要查明真相。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.47,0:00:39.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在接受左眼角膜移植后，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.21,0:00:44.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,每当受到撞击，爱之助眼前就会浮现出神秘画面。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.22,0:00:49.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他开始怀疑，这些或许是哥哥曾经看过的景象。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.37,0:00:52.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在保健老师狭山瞳的协助下，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.24,0:00:55.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他终于一步步逼近真相。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:00:59.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抢劫银行，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.60,0:01:05.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,乃至恐怖分子的病毒袭击。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.49,0:01:09.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助终于发现，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:13.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这一切罪案的幕后黑手竟是自己的哥哥梦人，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.27,0:01:14.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而梦人的真正目的，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.91,0:01:19.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是从警方手中夺回存有犯罪计划的笔记本电脑。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.95,0:01:24.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来哥哥还活着，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.32,0:01:29.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,并且是一个犯罪团伙的头目。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:31.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,电脑虽然保住了，但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:33.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是左眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:38.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是我给你的那只左眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.12,0:01:40.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥，住手吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.67,0:01:42.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.39,0:01:44.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但我会继续做下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.82,0:01:46.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:51.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道你想杀了我？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.13,0:01:57.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算杀了你也可以……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.20,0:02:13.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,起立。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.41,0:02:17.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,敬礼。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.95,0:02:33.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第1集
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.31,0:02:47.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.44,0:02:51.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,听到我声音的人，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.21,0:02:55.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们有家人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:03:00.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那种彼此互相关心的……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:02.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真正的家人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:05.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算不生活在一起也没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.81,0:03:09.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要心中把对方当作家人，那就是家人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:14.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,曾经连我……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:16.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也有最亲近的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.99,0:03:21.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一直以为，没有比我们更好的家人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.67,0:03:23.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,然而我的哥哥，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.09,0:03:28.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,已经不在我身边了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:33.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个把左眼给我的哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.08,0:03:34.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,已经不在了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.31,0:04:05.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.09,0:04:15.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:19.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真抱歉，只能把你丢在雨里。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:23.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是舞家里不准养狗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:25.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们养不起你。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.63,0:04:36.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,它没有家人，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.47,0:04:38.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以孤零零的一个。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.85,0:04:40.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真是孤零零的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.51,0:04:45.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你愿意跟我走吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.07,0:04:51.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢大哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:57.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,舞的家就在那边。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.19,0:04:59.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有空要来找我玩哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.85,0:05:41.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,给你起个什么名字好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.19,0:05:49.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凛。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:52.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,叫凛吧，因为你威风凛凛的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.53,0:06:02.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,已经过去3个月了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:05.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从那以后，这只眼睛什么画面也没看到过。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.26,0:06:08.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算受到撞击，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.41,0:06:10.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也再没有出现过神秘画面。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.69,0:06:16.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我会破坏你的计划，阻止你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.14,0:06:19.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有本事你就试试看。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.12,0:06:22.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过到时候可别抱怨，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.17,0:06:25.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪怕哪天我不得不杀了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.89,0:06:28.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:32.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我确信哥哥一定在谋划着什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.42,0:06:35.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定要阻止他。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.03,0:06:39.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪怕赌上性命，我也一定要阻止他。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:45.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凡有的，还要加给他，叫他有余；
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.25,0:06:49.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凡没有的，连他所有的也要夺去。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.19,0:06:58.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这本书里有时也能读出正确的道理。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.39,0:07:05.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:10.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为了执行计划，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:16.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经帮你安排进了福地警视手下的警局。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.95,0:07:22.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,听说他是个低调沉稳的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.03,0:07:33.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,已经过去3个月了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.48,0:07:37.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,差不多该开始了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.21,0:08:24.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是福地警视。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.53,0:08:27.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,黑晶晶——
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.62,0:08:32.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,曾经是天才犯罪策划人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.57,0:08:35.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过那也仅仅是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.86,0:08:39.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在新王者出现之前的事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.00,0:08:50.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这台笔记本电脑，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:55.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,属于据传在犯罪策划上超越了你的那个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.92,0:08:59.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我希望你能破解它，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.97,0:09:04.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让我们能获取里面隐藏的情报。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.67,0:09:23.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,郁美！郁美！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.43,0:09:38.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求你，不要！！！郁美！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:35.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.99,0:10:43.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,左眼侦探EYE
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:45.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,翻译 - Annyti
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.25,0:10:46.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,校对 - SimusiK
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:48.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,英文字幕鸣谢 JUMP-in Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.41,0:10:52.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你好，这里是保健室。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.18,0:10:54.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请问是狭山瞳女士吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.18,0:10:57.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您这个月的信用卡账单还没有还清。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.37,0:10:58.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我会还的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.82,0:11:01.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我现在马上就去还！对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.53,0:11:05.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这可怎么办啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:17.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我分期付款买的东西，居然……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.68,0:11:21.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,居然还剩872,140日元？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:26.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是那双短靴真的太好看了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.60,0:11:36.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不行，这不可能……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.28,0:11:37.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:41.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哎呀，全撕破了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:55.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,糟了，要迟到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.27,0:11:58.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,得赶快跑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.95,0:12:06.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,时隔三个月，又看到画面了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.25,0:12:08.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是否意味着，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:12.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥又开始行动了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:20.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个画面到底代表什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:23.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我需要更多线索。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:24.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:27.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能再看到些什么就好了……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.80,0:12:33.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么也看不到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.03,0:12:39.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今天一定要揍爱之助一顿。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.95,0:12:43.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要揍他，他就会看到画面。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:47.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要看到画面，就能破案。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.02,0:12:49.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要破了案，警察就会感谢我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.90,0:12:53.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要警察感谢我们，就能拿到谢礼。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.05,0:12:56.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要拿到谢礼，我就能还清债务了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.43,0:13:02.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也就是说，只要揍了爱之助，我就自由了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:06.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然我确实是个老师……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:09.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,本来应该保护学生的老师……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.49,0:13:10.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.22,0:13:12.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是但是但是但是……！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.33,0:13:13.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今天无论如何
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.67,0:13:17.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我都要狠狠揍爱之助一拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:32.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.68,0:13:35.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哟！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:36.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,早上好。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:37.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,早上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.27,0:13:39.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师，你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.29,0:13:42.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:46.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,早上这样打个招呼，整个人不就精神一整天了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.15,0:14:01.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算老师打我，也是没用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.04,0:14:02.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,之前已经试过很多次了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.99,0:14:05.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是、可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.53,0:14:07.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,上次我们帮了警察，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.09,0:14:12.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是拿到了丰厚的谢礼呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.09,0:14:20.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你不想再向那些害死你哥哥的家伙复仇了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.38,0:14:22.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你难道打算放弃吗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.15,0:14:29.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以说……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.46,0:14:34.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们必须让你那只神奇的眼睛……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.54,0:14:38.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不可能随心所欲看到老师想看的画面。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.72,0:14:39.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我先走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:50.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是我又看不到未来……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.20,0:14:53.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狭山瞳老师。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.92,0:14:58.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,三个月前她帮过我。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.50,0:15:00.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.09,0:15:04.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师并不知道哥哥的真面目。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:06.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,至今……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.31,0:15:10.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,她还以为哥哥是被罪犯杀害的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.44,0:15:14.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警方也是这么认为的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.77,0:15:19.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,开始吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:26.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今天讨论绑架案。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.09,0:15:27.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.23,0:15:31.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,趁母亲不注意时，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.12,0:15:34.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人连同婴儿车一起绑架了一岁的平井郁美，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.29,0:15:36.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,并驾驶一辆黑色面包车逃跑。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:39.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们未能拍清车牌号，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:41.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以目前还无法确定犯人的位置。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.54,0:15:43.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在孩子被扣为人质，
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.93,0:15:45.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人索要赎金。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.31,0:15:46.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,赎金金额为100万日元。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.79,0:15:49.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人已经发来了指示：
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.43,0:15:53.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“交给在大地上奔走、守卫地狱之门者”。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.90,0:15:55.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这段是……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:59.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,受害者父亲按照指示行动的监控录像。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.07,0:16:02.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,按照犯人的要求，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:08.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他把100万日元放进狗的背包里，然后放走了狗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.03,0:16:12.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,带着赎金的狗在新中川附近出现过，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.15,0:16:14.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但目前还不清楚它的确切位置。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.42,0:16:17.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个计划真奇怪。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.49,0:16:18.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:21.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,讨论犯人的目的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.72,0:16:25.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,目前警方正在追踪那只黑狗，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:27.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,以期掌握线索，查明犯人的目的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.36,0:16:41.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,背着背包的狗……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:49.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小女孩小舞……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.44,0:16:56.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,想不通。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.66,0:16:58.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,线索太少了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.76,0:17:28.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,梦人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.31,0:17:40.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助……抱歉。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.93,0:17:44.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我只是觉得应该通知你一声。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:47.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.87,0:17:51.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我的天才犯罪计划……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:55.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,已经启动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:17:58.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,住手吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.90,0:18:06.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定会阻止你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.73,0:18:08.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.18,0:18:12.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定会阻止你。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.51,0:18:14.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哦，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.76,0:18:18.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,挺自信的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:21.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你知道些什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.86,0:18:23.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,算了，无所谓。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.56,0:18:26.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那你就好好努力吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.13,0:18:41.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在担心弟弟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.51,0:18:46.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要不要我杀了他？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.05,0:18:52.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.60,0:18:54.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你到底在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.50,0:19:07.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道是……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:10.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.25,0:19:47.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.86,0:19:51.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不好意思，突然打扰……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.35,0:19:53.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您不用害怕。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.77,0:19:56.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是住在附近的如月中学三年级学生。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.05,0:19:57.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我叫田中爱之助。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.05,0:20:02.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,最近您身边有发生什么奇怪的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.25,0:20:07.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,或者是小舞？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.22,0:20:08.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.14,0:20:09.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有，我……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:11.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么都没发生过。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.61,0:20:13.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别靠近小舞。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.33,0:20:18.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你要是敢对她做什么，我就报警。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.95,0:21:17.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,早上好。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.51,0:21:21.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！你听说了吗？有婴儿被绑架了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.92,0:21:25.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就在这附近，好吓人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.64,0:21:27.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:32.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.93,0:21:36.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人也太残忍了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.43,0:21:39.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不去找有十亿日元的人要十亿日元，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.53,0:21:44.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明知受害人家里连维持生计都很艰难，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.76,0:21:47.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,却还要折磨人家，榨取那点钱。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:49.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太残酷了……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.26,0:21:51.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么能做出这种事？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.49,0:21:58.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我的天才犯罪计划……已经开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.61,0:22:00.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,早上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.51,0:22:02.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我也听说那件事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.95,0:22:06.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不是跟你说过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.10,0:22:09.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别穿成这样出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.72,0:22:13.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,竟然派了只小狗去拿赎金？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.51,0:22:15.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,汪汪。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:19.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对了，关于那封信……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.39,0:22:23.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“交给在大地上行走、守护地狱之门者。”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.94,0:22:27.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可怜的小狗怎么就成守护地狱之门了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.06,0:22:30.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就像地狱三头犬那样吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.75,0:22:33.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我先走啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.90,0:22:42.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你不用去上学吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.32,0:22:44.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.41,0:22:51.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绑架……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.08,0:22:55.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,100万日元的赎金……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.46,0:22:58.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,人质被释放了……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.60,0:23:04.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥不可能只是为了区区100万日元做这种事……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.11,0:23:06.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那又是为了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.97,0:23:10.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,完全想不通他的真正目的。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.73,0:23:23.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那篇报道里提到的狗，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.20,0:23:26.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,应该就是它吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.33,0:23:29.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那鸽子又是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.08,0:23:34.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可恶……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.31,0:23:37.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,光凭这些根本弄不明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.05,0:23:41.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了，左眼，再显现一次吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.82,0:23:44.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再给我一点线索！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.05,0:23:59.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.68,0:24:03.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.24,0:24:04.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.38,0:24:06.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我有点贫血。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.38,0:24:08.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.22,0:24:20.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你好像是田中爱之助吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.38,0:24:22.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的，你是……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.48,0:24:26.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,三班的海藤正树。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.00,0:24:27.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我身体不太好，
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.22,0:24:30.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,经常请假，所以你可能不认得我。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.29,0:24:36.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你的便当呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.14,0:24:40.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我没有买便当的钱。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.47,0:24:42.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我家特别穷。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.81,0:24:47.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哎呀，我不小心说太多了。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.23,0:24:50.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有，我只是在想：
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.77,0:24:53.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“换作是我，肯定没办法这么坦然地说出来。”
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.64,0:24:57.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实我家也差不多。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.38,0:25:02.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,重要的是活得堂堂正正。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.02,0:25:04.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,贫穷并不是什么耻辱。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.65,0:25:08.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是我妈妈常说的。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.85,0:25:11.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然听起来很像电视剧里的台词。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.26,0:25:15.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你妈妈真坚强。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.67,0:25:18.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,她是上门护理员。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.37,0:25:21.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以平时非常忙……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.77,0:25:24.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要不是我身体太弱……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.93,0:25:27.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,本来也能帮帮她的……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.08,0:25:41.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.10,0:25:43.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.76,0:25:55.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊，是白鸽。平时可不多见呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.48,0:26:02.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,来了……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.52,0:26:07.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.69,0:26:08.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又来了？开始了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.64,0:26:10.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是那个画面吗，爱之助？！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.94,0:26:13.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师，你刚才一直都在跟踪我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.10,0:26:16.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么能凭空污蔑人呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.44,0:26:17.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.74,0:26:19.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能麻烦你转过去一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.43,0:26:20.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明白了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.64,0:26:22.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,千万别回头看哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.37,0:26:23.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好的……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.55,0:26:24.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助，准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.67,0:26:27.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请使出全力打我。
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.02,0:26:29.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.72,0:26:48.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“诱拐仍在继续”
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.92,0:26:50.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“M将死”
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.52,0:27:53.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.12,0:27:57.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你的女儿在我手里。
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.59,0:28:00.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.55,0:28:03.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你刚才说了“绑架”？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.09,0:28:04.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的吗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.09,0:28:07.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这么说奖金能拿到大概十亿日元？！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.82,0:28:11.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经看到成堆的钻石、钞票和黄金了！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.49,0:28:13.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绑架和小舞……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.94,0:28:17.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.76,0:28:21.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.36,0:28:22.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,果然！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.30,0:28:25.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那些鸽子就是下一起绑架案的线索！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.77,0:28:27.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,手机借我一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.96,0:28:29.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拿去！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.93,0:28:44.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请帮我转接大内刑警。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.83,0:28:45.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.71,0:28:46.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他不在？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.20,0:28:48.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就转给加藤刑警。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.74,0:28:49.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.93,0:28:52.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,开完会就外出了？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.62,0:28:56.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我有非常重要的线索……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.24,0:28:59.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,居然挂断了。
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.14,0:29:00.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.81,0:29:02.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉！下次再聊！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.20,0:29:07.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等！我有加藤刑警的手机号！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.18,0:29:46.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？我是佐野……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.18,0:29:48.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警察？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.37,0:29:51.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有，我没报警。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.11,0:29:54.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请问小舞她没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.48,0:29:57.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,准备好400万日元。
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.47,0:30:00.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,400万日元？！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.52,0:30:02.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我没有那么多钱！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.50,0:30:05.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.11,0:30:07.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.72,0:30:15.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是她真的凑齐了400万日元……该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.57,0:30:16.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凑不齐的。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.31,0:30:21.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个母亲的能力也就那种程度。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.60,0:30:28.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算凑齐了，结果也不会改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.84,0:30:32.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然是这样，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.77,0:30:36.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但那就没有美感了。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.79,0:30:40.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,美感吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.11,0:30:48.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那当然，犯罪最重要的就是美感。
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.95,0:30:56.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可恶……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.38,0:30:59.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生的电话打不通。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.97,0:31:02.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第二起事件的详情呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.53,0:31:07.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,目前还不能完全确定是否与第一起绑架案有关。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.11,0:31:09.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,两起案件非常相似。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.89,0:31:11.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 什么？\N- 只是推测。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.37,0:31:15.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 讲详情！\N- 是。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.10,0:31:20.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,受害者是佐野舞，小学二年级，8岁，住在篠出町。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.01,0:31:23.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人索要400万日元的赎金。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.59,0:31:24.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人的交易条件呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.07,0:31:28.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,之后犯人没再打电话，但发来了这条信息：
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.83,0:31:37.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“交给衔着橄榄枝振翅之物”。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.35,0:31:43.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“橄榄枝”？“翅膀”？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.48,0:31:48.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助，你究竟看到了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.49,0:31:50.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,之前不是已经发生过一起绑架案吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.90,0:31:54.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那次是用狗取走赎金的。
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.81,0:31:59.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绑架案还没有结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.22,0:32:02.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.33,0:32:08.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也就是说，这次的受害者是……
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.02,0:32:14.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还不够。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.96,0:32:26.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求您……我保证一定会还的……能借我一点吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.69,0:32:29.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,非常抱歉，按照规定我们不能借。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.26,0:32:33.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是小舞有生命危险啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.94,0:32:36.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉，但规定就是规定。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.84,0:32:38.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请您冷静一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.05,0:32:43.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,佐野女士，有您的快递。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.31,0:32:46.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请开一下门。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.75,0:32:56.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是快递员。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.75,0:32:58.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 有您的快递。\N- 好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.61,0:33:00.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请在这里签字。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.58,0:33:05.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这边走。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.67,0:33:10.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请慢慢把箱子放下，一定要轻拿轻放。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.74,0:33:27.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来不是炸弹。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.98,0:33:35.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鸽子？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.84,0:33:38.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.09,0:33:44.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“将赎金放入筒中后放飞”。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.57,0:33:48.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,果然和福地警视说的一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.59,0:33:51.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.68,0:34:06.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一定要赶上啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.26,0:34:11.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是福地。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.12,0:34:14.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已就位。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.67,0:34:16.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,收到！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.82,0:34:20.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,放飞鸽子。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.39,0:34:34.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鸽子正朝东南方向飞去。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.63,0:34:39.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,全员注意，绝不能跟丢！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.46,0:34:45.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们正在追踪鸽子。它们正朝东南方向的中川下游飞去。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.70,0:34:51.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算利用天空运送赎金，鸽子迟早也得落下来。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.38,0:34:53.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,继续追踪。
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.93,0:34:59.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,它们改变了方向，现在正朝西南方向飞去。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.11,0:35:03.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绝不能放过这么精于算计的犯人。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.18,0:35:29.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鸽子正以70公里的时速向三浦半岛叶山町方向西南飞行。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.55,0:35:32.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从B点转移到F点。
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.17,0:36:00.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.13,0:36:02.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.34,0:36:04.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 别在工作时间给我打电话。\N- 是鸽子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.86,0:36:08.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 什么？\N- 它是下一起绑架案的线索。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.59,0:36:10.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.66,0:36:16.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第二起绑架案的信息是严格保密的。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.55,0:36:19.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,告诉我，快告诉我！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.39,0:36:20.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,出什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.95,0:36:24.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 你打电话就是为了这个？\N- 对，我想告诉您关于鸽子的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.42,0:36:27.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你看到了？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.66,0:36:29.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.37,0:36:31.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还是感觉到了？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.35,0:36:38.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂，3个月前你不是有过某种神奇的能力吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.08,0:36:46.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道是因为失去哥哥的打击，觉醒了这种能力？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.76,0:36:53.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道被绑架的是佐野舞？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.33,0:36:58.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？\N- 你认识她？篠出町的佐野舞。
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.53,0:37:01.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可恶，我来晚了。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.95,0:37:07.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在那边！鸽子！鸽子！在那边，那边！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.75,0:37:09.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是加藤。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.35,0:37:13.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鸽子位置在东南方向100米处。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.28,0:37:24.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,它们减速了。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.01,0:37:46.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,头儿，这里出现了一大群鸽子！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.82,0:37:48.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不知道该盯哪一只了！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.16,0:37:52.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,赎金……
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.09,0:38:20.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,运送赎金的鸽子……
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.41,0:38:21.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,晚上本来就是不飞的。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.46,0:38:26.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.83,0:38:28.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请问是狭山瞳女士吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.80,0:38:35.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是YY金融的谷田部，早上给您打过电话。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.49,0:38:40.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您这个月的贷款还没还呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.06,0:38:44.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有人在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.25,0:38:46.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是您家吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.24,0:38:48.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狭山瞳女士。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.47,0:38:53.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一不小心走过头了。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.65,0:38:54.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请问是狭山瞳女士吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.49,0:38:58.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这全是胡说八道！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.94,0:39:01.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他在跟踪我！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.47,0:39:04.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为我太漂亮了……很吓人对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.78,0:39:07.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我说，狭山老师……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.65,0:39:14.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,劝您最好别进我的黑名单。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.32,0:39:18.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,听到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.27,0:39:20.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊，我们去学校吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.43,0:39:22.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狭山老师？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.19,0:39:24.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,去那边再计划。走吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.72,0:39:26.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.90,0:39:35.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.17,0:39:40.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,接电话。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.10,0:39:50.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,钱没给够啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.53,0:39:56.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是你不够努力吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.62,0:40:02.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看穷人拼命凑钱的样子，还真是有趣。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.83,0:40:08.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经很努力去凑钱了……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.83,0:40:10.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不想听借口。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.24,0:40:15.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那小舞呢……小舞……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.23,0:40:18.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.63,0:40:22.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样？求求你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.87,0:40:25.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞……小舞……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.65,0:40:30.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.67,0:40:34.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,跟丢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.89,0:40:37.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可恶……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.86,0:40:56.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢你，大哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.59,0:41:13.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.88,0:41:15.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人来电话了。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.68,0:41:18.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,目前还是不知道小舞被关在哪里。
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.86,0:41:20.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.94,0:41:26.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.93,0:41:29.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.54,0:41:31.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.53,0:41:52.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我本来应该想到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.63,0:41:56.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,左眼看到的小舞……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.71,0:42:01.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有那起绑架案……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.44,0:42:07.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是我能把这两幅画面联系起来，早就明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.77,0:42:11.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.36,0:42:15.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了，左眼，让我看到吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.44,0:42:19.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,住手，爱之助！快停下！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.94,0:42:26.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是哥哥能看到这一切……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.00,0:42:29.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看到他犯下的罪行……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.50,0:42:35.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他怎么能……对那个小女孩……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.32,0:42:38.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.91,0:42:43.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你哥哥一定是被威胁了。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.76,0:42:50.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以才帮了罪犯，最后还被害死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.06,0:42:57.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别把哥哥想得那么坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.95,0:43:04.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我相信他当时一定很痛苦。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.68,0:43:09.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以，爱之助，别那样说他。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.57,0:43:18.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他可是你唯一的家人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.29,0:43:25.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢您，老师。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.97,0:43:36.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不用谢……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.26,0:43:41.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,振作起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.09,0:43:46.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们一起把那伙强盗抓住！好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.21,0:43:51.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师，不是那样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.96,0:44:01.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实我哥哥还活着，现在正在策划新的犯罪。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.79,0:44:14.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你哥哥总会出现在有警察的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.76,0:44:20.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是敢碍事……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.84,0:44:26.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我有比杀掉他更好的办法。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.09,0:44:44.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,天才犯罪计划已经开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.36,0:44:48.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第一起案子索要了100万日元赎金，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.09,0:44:52.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是用狗来运送的。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.10,0:44:55.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第二起案子绑架了小舞。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.86,0:44:58.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人索要了400万日元。
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.43,0:45:01.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,并且用鸽子取走了赎金。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.90,0:45:06.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又借口金额不足，他们……
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.55,0:45:10.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞……
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.05,0:45:14.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,到现在还没把小舞放回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.78,0:45:30.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起，凛。
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.04,0:45:33.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,吓到你了，对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.81,0:46:12.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看你们脸上的表情，是被耍得团团转呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.12,0:46:15.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,笔记本电脑破解了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.33,0:46:17.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.17,0:46:20.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这里的防御系统相当坚固。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.83,0:46:25.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且解读密码的思路也很关键。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.78,0:46:31.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人是在故意拖延时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.13,0:46:38.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他喜欢故弄玄虚，绝不会走寻常路。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.14,0:46:39.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也就是说……？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.66,0:46:41.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也就是说……
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.46,0:46:46.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他觉得无聊了。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.59,0:46:51.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然不知道他现在在策划什么，但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.20,0:46:57.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要有选择，他一定会选风险最高的。
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.40,0:47:03.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,更有趣、更耗时，
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.74,0:47:06.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且更残忍的方法。
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.78,0:47:30.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,救命……
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.22,0:48:18.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞……
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.41,0:48:29.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.38,0:48:34.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是你吗？之前来过的就是你吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.62,0:48:38.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你就是犯人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.54,0:48:40.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是不是你？！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.91,0:48:42.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.48,0:48:46.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求你把小舞还给我。
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.71,0:48:51.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请把小舞还给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.81,0:48:57.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把小舞还给我……
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.11,0:49:01.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求你了……求求你……
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.67,0:49:05.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事的，他是来帮我们的。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.85,0:49:08.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人可能在监视，先进屋吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.09,0:49:11.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你也进来。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.01,0:49:14.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,电话！快！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.44,0:49:19.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？\N- 好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.61,0:49:24.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂，我是佐野。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.56,0:49:30.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经把你女儿放了。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.82,0:49:37.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过，既然你没能凑齐赎金，
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.05,0:49:42.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我就不会告诉你她在哪里。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.92,0:49:47.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,凭她自己是逃不出来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.80,0:49:52.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是不抓紧时间，她可是会死的。
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.10,0:49:56.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,求求你，把她还……
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.42,0:50:02.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们还剩2个小时。祝你们好运。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.81,0:50:11.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等一下！求求你等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.78,0:50:16.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好吧，再给你一个提示。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.75,0:50:25.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,之前用的是狗和鸽子。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.03,0:50:32.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这次是另一种动物。
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.48,0:50:46.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鸽子先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.53,0:50:52.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刚才明明有那么多的，都去哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.58,0:50:58.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.11,0:51:00.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你又能看到什么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.16,0:51:02.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我得看看这次用的是什么动物。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.30,0:51:04.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 怎么又是动物？\N- 别管了！快揍我一拳。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.98,0:51:06.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好。
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.41,0:51:26.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.07,0:51:28.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看到了吗？看到什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.47,0:51:41.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鸭子？牛？马？蜥蜴？河马？长颈鹿？犀牛？猴子？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.88,0:51:44.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,自己出不来？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.55,0:51:46.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,2小时后会死？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.89,0:51:55.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是被注射了毒药？缺氧？还是被活埋了？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.88,0:51:57.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这次到底是什么动物？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.82,0:52:03.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不好意思，能让我看一下后座吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.52,0:52:13.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在找乐子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.03,0:52:16.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,觉得无聊？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.03,0:52:19.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喜欢冒险？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.82,0:52:22.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,提示是动物？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.41,0:52:23.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,豹子？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.15,0:52:24.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,猪？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.30,0:52:25.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,山羊？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.49,0:52:26.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,隼？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.18,0:52:29.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,猛犸象？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.44,0:52:31.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,猎豹？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.50,0:52:38.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不对，猎豹说过了。\N两个角的？㺢㹢狓！是㺢㹢狓吗？！㺢㹢狓？！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.36,0:52:39.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师，就是这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.92,0:52:41.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.94,0:52:45.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不是。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.48,0:52:49.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不是。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.76,0:52:50.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不是。
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.59,0:52:53.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不是。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.93,0:53:07.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂，我是加藤。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.17,0:53:09.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 加藤先生，我知道了！\N- 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.63,0:53:12.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请相信我的直觉，赶快过去！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.84,0:53:19.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.31,0:53:20.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就是……
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.28,0:53:27.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不好意思，我们没时间了。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.88,0:53:33.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,搜查全员请注意，去排查海边所有带有海狮标志的仓库！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.35,0:53:34.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.47,0:53:37.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,受害者就在其中一个带有海狮标志的仓库里。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.82,0:53:40.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请一定要救救她！拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.35,0:53:53.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,海狮标志的公司？那一带少说有一百家啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.25,0:53:56.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有没有别的线索能缩小地址？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.21,0:54:03.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对了，光顾着拼图都给忘了……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.67,0:54:07.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个风车到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.48,0:54:10.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道是风力发电厂？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.80,0:54:15.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,发电厂附近的仓库……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.72,0:54:18.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.52,0:54:33.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请出示您的驾照。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.99,0:54:43.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.94,0:54:47.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这附近有仓库吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.80,0:54:53.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,发电厂旁边好像就有一家。
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.62,0:54:57.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,感谢您的配合。
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.78,0:56:02.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在带有海狮标志的仓库里找到佐野舞了！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.30,0:56:08.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,她没事吧？小舞没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.63,0:56:28.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,出来了！小舞看起来没事。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.27,0:56:32.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们马上就到。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.60,0:56:34.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞……
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.19,0:56:50.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞，你怎么样？小舞？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.07,0:56:55.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞，小舞，坚持住。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.11,0:56:56.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞。
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.92,0:56:58.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.51,0:57:02.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.74,0:57:05.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.86,0:57:08.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,狗狗呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.88,0:57:12.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在家里呢，它很好。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.09,0:57:17.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 我给它起名叫凛。\N- 太好了……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.61,0:57:21.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能请您先出来一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.97,0:57:24.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.21,0:57:25.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.93,0:57:29.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小舞！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.86,0:57:31.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,妈妈……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.96,0:57:34.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.52,0:57:36.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉。
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.98,0:57:50.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,佐野舞已经恢复意识了。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.46,0:58:07.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.68,0:58:11.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,已经没事了。你做得很好。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.66,0:58:17.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太好了……多亏了你的线索，附近的警官才能找到她。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.56,0:58:33.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么……不……难道说？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.65,0:58:47.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是青坂署的向坂。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.44,0:58:58.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,开始吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.12,0:58:59.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.78,0:59:02.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,佐野女士想向大家道谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.48,0:59:04.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.14,0:59:17.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这就是所谓的天才计划吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.69,0:59:23.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,打电话给福地警视。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.55,0:59:26.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,告诉他黑晶晶已经成功破解了防御。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.84,0:59:43.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是福地。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.58,0:59:46.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.44,0:59:48.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我马上来。
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.28,0:59:50.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.55,0:59:53.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 我也高兴！\N- 我也太开心了！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.98,0:59:58.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,立了这么大功，会有谢礼的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.25,1:00:00.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.60,1:00:05.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,果然如此，绝对少不了谢礼！不知道会有多少呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.37,1:00:07.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.87,1:00:10.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤刑警。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.40,1:00:16.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.00,1:00:19.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么哥哥会……
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.40,1:00:30.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真正的较量现在才要开始呢，弟弟。
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.17,1:00:32.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.14,1:00:48.00,SongTop,,0,0,0,,即使眼中映出的世界满是悲伤
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.23,1:00:54.67,SongTop,,0,0,0,,我们的青春物语也绝不再逃避
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.76,1:01:02.66,SongTop,,0,0,0,,凝视前方 一定能寻找到光芒
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.76,1:01:10.46,SongTop,,0,0,0,,因为想看到泪水过后的未来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.66,1:01:17.33,SongTop,,0,0,0,,就算对未来感到不安 也不要敷衍逃避
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.58,1:01:23.83,SongTop,,0,0,0,,不要对自己说谎
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.12,1:01:31.26,SongTop,,0,0,0,,纵然迷茫 迷茫 再迷茫 依然怀揣梦想 追逐梦想
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.42,1:01:38.10,SongTop,,0,0,0,,坚信这份心意终能传达 直到实现
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.22,1:01:46.18,SongTop,,0,0,0,,凝视前方 我们一定能寻找到光芒
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.39,1:01:52.45,SongTop,,0,0,0,,因为想看到泪水过后的未来
